     H***TEXT:Pick confirm - catch weight entry
     H*
     H* OE020  - PICK CONFIRM / CATCH WEIGHT            DKOWALSKI  05/20/98
     H* PICKER KEYS ORDER AND LINE, SCALE WEIGHT, F6 TO RECORD.
     H* FUNCTION KEYS READ FROM THE WORKSTN FEEDBACK AREA, NOT INDICATORS.
     H*
     FOE020DF CF  E                    WORKSTN
     F                                              KINFDS WSDS
     FORDDTL  UF  E           K        DISK
     FORDHDR  IF  E           K        DISK
     FCUSTMASTIF  E           K        DISK
     FITEMMASTIF  E           K        DISK
     E                    MSG     1  10 50
     IWSDS        DS
     I                                      369 369 KEY
     IKEYDS       DS
     I                                        1   60CUST#
     C           DTKEY     KLIST
     C                     KFLD           SORDNO
     C                     KFLD           SLINE
     C           KEY       DOWNEX'33'
     C                     EXFMTOE020R1
     C                     MOVE *BLANKS   SMSG
     C           KEY       IFEQ X'3C'
     C                     EXSR RESET
     C                     END
     C           KEY       IFNE X'33'
     C           KEY       ANDNEX'3C'
     C                     EXSR SHOW
     C                     END
     C                     END
     C                     SETON                     LR
     C                     RETRN
     C           SHOW      BEGSR
     C           DTKEY     CHAINORDDTL               90
     C           *IN90     IFEQ '1'
     C                     MOVE MSG,8     SMSG
     C                     GOTO SHOWND
     C                     END
     C           DORDNO    CHAINORDHDR               91
     C                     Z-ADDOCUST     CUST#
     C           CUST#     CHAINCUSTMAST             92
     C  N92                MOVE CNAME     SNAME
     C           DITEM     CHAINITEMMAST             93
     C                     Z-ADDDITEM     SITEM
     C  N93                MOVE IDESC     SIDESC
     C                     Z-ADDQTYSHP    SQTY
     C* X'36' IS F6
     C           KEY       IFEQ X'36'
     C                     Z-ADDSCWGHT    CWGHT
     C                     UPDATORDDTLR
     C                     MOVE MSG,7     SMSG
     C                     END
     C           SHOWND    ENDSR
     C           RESET     BEGSR
     C                     Z-ADD0         SORDNO
     C                     Z-ADD0         SLINE
     C                     Z-ADD0         SITEM
     C                     Z-ADD0         SQTY
     C                     Z-ADD0         SCWGHT
     C                     MOVE *BLANKS   SNAME
     C                     MOVE *BLANKS   SIDESC
     C                     ENDSR
**
CUSTOMER NOT FOUND                                
ITEM NOT FOUND                                    
LINE ADDED - ENTER NEXT ITEM OR F3 TO EXIT        
ORDER CANCELLED                                   
ENTER QUANTITY                                    
ITEM NOT PRICED                                   
WEIGHT RECORDED                                   
ORDER LINE NOT FOUND                              
CUSTOMER UPDATED                                  
CUSTOMER ADDED                                    
